#  |
#  v
# Validation Pipeline:
#
# 1. Structure
# 2. Distractors
# 3. Grounding
# 4. Topic relevance
# 5. Focus
# 6. Semantic
# 7. Domain correctness
# 8. Quality score
#
# Output:
# Accepted question OR None
#
